Package: pbtm
Type: Package
Title: Population-Based Threshold Models of Seed Germination
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Bello", email = "pedrobello@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ben", "Bradford", email = "bradfordium@gmail.com", role = "aut"))
Description: Fits population-based threshold models (PBTMs) to seed
    germination time courses, as described by Bradford and Bello (2022)
    <doi:10.19103/AS.2022.0105.05>. Supports thermal time, hydrotime,
    hydrothermal time, hydropriming, hydrothermal priming, aging, promoter
    and inhibitor models, optional mixtures of seed subpopulations,
    germination speed calculations, and plots of the fitted models on linear
    or linearized (log time, probit fraction) scales.
